        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: 50 Cent, Prodigy, Havoc, Yo Gotti, Trey Songz, Kidd Kidd, Jadakiss, Mr Probz, Guordan Banks, Schoolboy Q, Styles P\n- Products: Animal Ambition, Smoke\n- Groups: Mobb Deep\n\nFacts:\n- \"Smoke\" is a song by American hip hop artist 50 Cent that was released on March 31, 2014, as the fourth single from his fifth studio album \"Animal Ambition\".\n- The 2014 album \"Animal Ambition\" features guest appearances from Yo Gotti, Trey Songz, Kidd Kidd, Jadakiss, Mr Probz, Guordan Banks, Prodigy, Schoolboy Q, and Styles P.\n- Albert Johnson, known professionally as Prodigy, was an American rapper, actor, and author who lived from November 2, 1974 to June 20, 2017.\n- Prodigy was one half of the hip hop duo Mobb Deep with Havoc.",
